      "value": "@{62389bb1047f2c66131b0ae9|full_name}: Ah, I understand what you are referring to now. Fundamentally, transparency sorting is difficult and so the only realistic options are 'People in the mirror always render over nameplates' or 'Nameplates always render over people in the mirror'. The reason we opted for the former is that it seemed more likely for people to be behind the mirror where you would want yourself prioritized than in front of the mirror whose nameplates you would want to see.",
